(7694440, 1261385, 143116, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup of a pineapple, if I''m not mistaken.</td>', 'Nice closeup of a pineapple, if I''m not mistaken.', '2021-05-17 16:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7694441, 1261396, 143116, '<td valign="top">I had to look it up, this Polyphemus. But now I know its a single eyed cyclops. Like the picture.</td>', 'I had to look it up, this Polyphemus. But now I know its a single eyed cyclops. Like the picture.', '2021-05-17 16:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7694442, 1261261, 143116, '<td valign="top">I''m not so sure what you, the photographer, added to this piece of art.</td>', 'I''m not so sure what you, the photographer, added to this piece of art.', '2021-05-17 16:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7694443, 1261281, 143116, '<td valign="top">Those stone walls are beautiful indeed!</td>', 'Those stone walls are beautiful indeed!', '2021-05-17 16:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7694445, 1261333, 143116, '<td valign="top">With your title and picture you leave a lot of room for the spectator''s phantasy. Unfortunately I lack the imagination to appreciate this fully.</td>', 'With your title and picture you leave a lot of room for the spectator''s phantasy. Unfortunately I lack the imagination to appreciate this fully.', '2021-05-17 17:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7694446, 1261388, 143116, '<td valign="top">I love old churches, they can be very photogenic. But this is a bit funny with a purple sky, cut off towers - and a beautiful window part.</td>', 'I love old churches, they can be very photogenic. But this is a bit funny with a purple sky, cut off towers - and a beautiful window part.', '2021-05-17 17:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7694447, 1261307, 143116, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what to make of this - there is a lot to be seen, but I struggle to see a message. And the title doesn''t help me here.</td>', 'I''m not sure what to make of this - there is a lot to be seen, but I struggle to see a message. And the title doesn''t help me here.', '2021-05-17 17:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7694503, 1261337, 97225, '<td valign="top">Great texture, great entry. This is in my top 3 because it really addresses the challenge description.</td>', 'Great texture, great entry. This is in my top 3 because it really addresses the challenge description.', '2021-05-18 22:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7694504, 1261307, 97225, '<td valign="top">Fabulous! My top pick. 10.</td>', 'Fabulous! My top pick. 10.', '2021-05-18 22:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7694505, 1261126, 97225, '<td valign="top">Nice entry. In my top 3.</td>', 'Nice entry. In my top 3.', '2021-05-18 22:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7694507, 1261386, 97225, '<td valign="top">Great find for this challenge. Top few.</td>', 'Great find for this challenge. Top few.', '2021-05-18 22:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7694508, 1261396, 173844, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous, living mosaic, elegantly presented.  An enchanting, subtle palette of milky blues, greens, corn, browns and blacks.  So very satisfying without the bravado of saturated fireworks.  The orange of the eye is a modest counterpoint, moody, inviting us into ancient realms.  Overall, a map of evolution''s peregrinations.<br/>Smack dab to the point of the challenge.  Great title.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'A gorgeous, living mosaic, elegantly presented.  An enchanting, subtle palette of milky blues, greens, corn, browns and blacks.  So very satisfying without the bravado of saturated fireworks.  The orange of the eye is a modest counterpoint, moody, inviting us into ancient realms.  Overall, a map of evolution''s peregrinations.Smack dab to the point of the challenge.  Great title.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2021-05-18 22:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7694509, 1261201, 173844, '<td valign="top">Face paint on an actress (assuming this is a woman), how assuredly a surface and a facade.  The stark white paint makes an elegant contrast to the muslin clothing.  Her  pale red lips make a tender, underplayed focus point.  Her expression is caught in full emotion.  Serenely dramatic.  Beautifully done.<br/>My only quibble is with her out of focus hand.  That and the brightness of it draws the eye away from rest of the image.  If I may be so bold, perhaps a crop from the lower left to tighten it up.  Just a suggestion.<br/>Had there been such a crop this would have been a co-favorite in the challenge.</td>', 'Face paint on an actress (assuming this is a woman), how assuredly a surface and a facade.  The stark white paint makes an elegant contrast to the muslin clothing.  Her  pale red lips make a tender, underplayed focus point.  Her expression is caught in full emotion.  Serenely dramatic.  Beautifully done.My only quibble is with her out of focus hand.  That and the brightness of it draws the eye away from rest of the image.  If I may be so bold, perhaps a crop from the lower left to tighten it up.  Just a suggestion.Had there been such a crop this would have been a co-favorite in the challenge.', '2021-05-19 00:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7694510, 1261400, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully, mysteriously suggestive and comely.  A billowing ocean, etc., perhaps.  That''s part of the fun, engaging the imagination.  The muted colors are nicely seasoned with rust.  The unusual composition is strangely satisfying.  How marvelous that you''ve found this on a burnt car door.</td>', 'Wonderfully, mysteriously suggestive and comely.  A billowing ocean, etc., perhaps.  That''s part of the fun, engaging the imagination.  The muted colors are nicely seasoned with rust.  The unusual composition is strangely satisfying.  How marvelous that you''ve found this on a burnt car door.', '2021-05-19 00:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7694511, 1261411, 173844, '<td valign="top">Charming and joyous, a happy morning of a wall.  Lovely color combination, aqua and tangerine.  Okay, blue and orange.  The mottled patchiness of the wall is lively and benign, inviting friendly conversation.  Utterly sumptuous.</td>', 'Charming and joyous, a happy morning of a wall.  Lovely color combination, aqua and tangerine.  Okay, blue and orange.  The mottled patchiness of the wall is lively and benign, inviting friendly conversation.  Utterly sumptuous.', '2021-05-19 00:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7694512, 1261395, 173844, '<td valign="top">All the more interesting because of the overlap of surfaces akin to one another.  The jacket has a studied, haphazard look, and in the background is de Kooning-cum graffiti.  They play off each other, as the photographer has so cunningly noticed.  One can even say the one is a facade for the other.  The overall shifting quality is fascinating.</td>', 'All the more interesting because of the overlap of surfaces akin to one another.  The jacket has a studied, haphazard look, and in the background is de Kooning-cum graffiti.  They play off each other, as the photographer has so cunningly noticed.  One can even say the one is a facade for the other.  The overall shifting quality is fascinating.', '2021-05-19 00:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7694513, 1261390, 173844, '<td valign="top">Dynamic juxtaposition of always entrancing bark and the bright, globular yellow and orange background.  It''s like a lava flow, or the horizon arc of a planet against the fiery sun.  Both simple and bold, it''s a depiction of nature in the raw.</td>', 'Dynamic juxtaposition of always entrancing bark and the bright, globular yellow and orange background.  It''s like a lava flow, or the horizon arc of a planet against the fiery sun.  Both simple and bold, it''s a depiction of nature in the raw.', '2021-05-19 00:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7694514, 1261249, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting x-ray-like image.  The frosted glass imparts a tantalizing softness, which enables the pressed body parts to have a starker impact.  Nice how the glass becomes facade only when joined up with something acting upon it.  Edvard Munch redux.</td>', 'Interesting x-ray-like image.  The frosted glass imparts a tantalizing softness, which enables the pressed body parts to have a starker impact.  Nice how the glass becomes facade only when joined up with something acting upon it.  Edvard Munch redux.', '2021-05-19 00:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7694515, 1261408, 173844, '<td valign="top">With the addition of rain, glass becomes facade.  It''s always delicately entrancing.  Here, it''s the landscape colors and set up that make it wonderful.</td>', 'With the addition of rain, glass becomes facade.  It''s always delicately entrancing.  Here, it''s the landscape colors and set up that make it wonderful.', '2021-05-19 00:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7694516, 1261407, 173844, '<td valign="top">Yes, the texture of the stone is interesting, but it''s the added shadows and metal fence and railing that break up the space into airy panels that make this a fine image.</td>', 'Yes, the texture of the stone is interesting, but it''s the added shadows and metal fence and railing that break up the space into airy panels that make this a fine image.', '2021-05-19 00:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7694519, 1261405, 114285, '<td valign="top">I meant to comment on this the first time around. I love the smooth effect that you achieved with the editing, congratulations on the red.</td>', 'I meant to comment on this the first time around. I love the smooth effect that you achieved with the editing, congratulations on the red.', '2021-05-19 01:05:50.000000', NULL, 0),
