(7694565, 1261307, 115814, '<td valign="top">This is a a facade of items glued onto the exterior of an old VW van owned by a migrant hippie, pot-smoking dude who called himself One Feather.  He used to hang around the beach in Santa Barbara, CA.<br/> <br/>Here he is in one of my favorite challenge entries. You can see a bit of the van facade in the background:<br/> <br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1076705" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1784/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1076705.jpg" xalt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1784/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1076705.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1784/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1076705.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/></a></td>', 'This is a a facade of items glued onto the exterior of an old VW van owned by a migrant hippie, pot-smoking dude who called himself One Feather.  He used to hang around the beach in Santa Barbara, CA. Here he is in one of my favorite challenge entries. You can see a bit of the van facade in the background: ', '2021-05-19 12:24:09.000000', NULL, 0),
